P actions make_etude
P memjob 3072000
P memory_limit 3000.0
P mode interactif
P nomjob AsterTargetTemperatureAdjoint
P version stable
A args -max_base 300000
A memjeveux 2048.0
A tpmax 20000.0
F comm AsterTargetTemperatureAdjointparam.in D  1
F comm AsterTargetTemperatureAdjoint.comm D  1
F libr AsterTargetTemperatureAdjointinput.med D  20
F rmed AsterTargetTemperatureAdjointoutput.rmed R 80
F mess AsterThermal.log R  6
